sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Client
  participant P1 as Job API
  participant P2 as Worker
  participant P3 as Store
  P0->>P1: Submit idempotent job
  P1->>P3: Commit job and outbox
  P1->>P0: 202 job ID
  P1->>P2: Dispatch leased attempt
  P2->>P3: Write result with fencing token
  P3->>P2: Durable completion
  P2->>P1: Acknowledge completion
  P0->>P1: Poll authorized result
